<title>INDIA: Indian forex market closed for Independence day.</title>
<headline>Indian forex market closed for Independence day.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian forex market is closed on Friday as banks are shut to celebrate Independence Day.</p>
<p>The Indian rupee closed at 35.7125/7175 per dollar on Thursday.</p>
<p>The forex market reopens on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91)-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
